---
// Client-side redirect for blog.html keeping query parameters
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Redirecting...</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.kubomontessori.com/blog" />
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace('/blog' + window.location.search);
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Redirecting to <a href="/blog">Blog</a>...</p>
  </body>
</html>
